%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: HelgenKeep_Ralof 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I decide to head with Ralof.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474599036452922
    - rid: 9079474599036452924
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We make our way into Helgen Keep.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474599036452926
    - rid: 9079474618519257089
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Looks like we're the only ones who made it...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: That thing was a dragon, no doubt.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Just like the children's stories and the legends. The harbingers of the
      End Times.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Heh. You've got <i>no</i> idea, buddy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You mind helping me with these bindings, Ralof?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah- come here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I make my way over to Ralof, who cuts my bindings with an iron dagger.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: There you go.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: You might as well take Gunjar's gear. He won't be needing it anymore.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... you know, seeing Gunjar's dead body in person?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'm surprised at how nonchalant Ralof is about the corpse of his comrade...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Don't know if that's a Nord thing, a 4th Era thing, a Tamriel thing,
      or just a Ralof thing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I smell the gear before taking it off of Gunjar.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Just to make sure, you know.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Well, it smells bad, but it doesn't smell like... waste material, so
      I guess it's fine...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I take the gear off of Gunjar.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... now that I think about it, how am I supposed to put this on?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: In the game this sort of thing is abstracted away as a menu interaction...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, Ralof, you mind giving me a hand with this?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh? Have you never worn armor before, boy?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'You know, his tone of voice doesn''t suggest anything, but the use of
      the word: "boy," really rubs me the wrong way.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... no.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ralof lets out a small chuckle, shakes his head, then comes over to help
      me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: After I get the tunic on, I slip on the fur boots. Without Ralof's help.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... they don't fit that well, but I'm not exactly in a position to be
      picky right about now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's also an iron axe at Gunjar's side, which I take.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474680798380212
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm going to see if I can find a way out of here...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ralof heads to the iron door on the other side of the room.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474680798380213
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It's gonna be locked-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: This one's locked, let's see about that gate.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Told ya so.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Damn. No way to open this from our side.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474680798380214
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There should be some Imperials coming around right about now-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cc2df41360429a84496bc5d6151fc651, type: 2}
    dialog: Come on, soldier. Keep moving!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: It's the Imperials! Take cover!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cc2df41360429a84496bc5d6151fc651, type: 2}
    dialog: Get this gate open!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: If I remember right, that captain should have the key to get out of here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Imperial dogs!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ralof charges in, going for the captain, which leaves me to deal with
      the other soldier...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883382
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883383
    - rid: 9079474705638883384
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I just killed a man for the first time...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883385
    - rid: 9079474705638883386
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe one of the Imperials had the key.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883387
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yep...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I search the Imperial captain's pockets, which was a lot harder to do
      than it is in game.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sure enough, there's the key that will unlock the door.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you find a key? Let's see if it unlocks that door.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I already know it will, so I promptly open the door, eager to move on
      from this experience.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883389
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Jesus-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883392
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh right, the ceiling caving in here was a scripted event in the game.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess that means the world I've found myself in follows the events
      of the game, to at least a certain degree.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We make our way through the dining area, encountering more Imperials.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883528
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883393
    - rid: 9079474705638883394
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883503
    - rid: 9079474705638883504
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883506
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883508
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883509
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us arrive to the torture room...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883512
    - rid: 9079474705638883514
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Troll's blood... it's a torture room!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'The two of us can hear fierce fighting between the torturer and a Stormcloak
      soldier. '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ralof goes charging in to help his comrade in the fight.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883515
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'm not nearly as enthusiastic for battle, so I make my way toward the
      fight at a brisk pace.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: By the time I've arrived, the torturer has already been slain.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883516
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Based on how the two of them are standing before the body, I'm guessing
      the torturer couldn't handle Ralof attacking from behind.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Was Jarl Ulfric with you?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b8f3f35a1754f8643acfe8c57dd64655, type: 2}
    dialog: No. I haven't seen him since the dragon showed up.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh, yeah. They don't know that Ulfric's made it out alive.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Of course not, they haven't played through their lives 35 times, like
      I have.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... did I just jinx myself?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: With Ulfric's whereabouts still unconfirmed, the three of us move on.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883517
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah crap-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883518
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's like four Imperials here!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ralof and the other soldier raise their weapons and charge into battle.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883519
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright, the odds aren't perfect, but I guess the best chance of survival
      would be to help out in the fight.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I try to slink around the back to ambush the archers from behind...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I manage to get the jump on one of them-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Instead of drawing a weapon, the Imperial raises his hands...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah crap, magic-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883520
    - rid: 9079474705638883521
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Jesus...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883522
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: While I fought the battlemage, Ralof and the other Stormcloak took care
      of the other two Imperials.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ralof starts moving on to the next room, without taking a pause.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess we're going...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883523
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah crap...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883524
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Frostbite spiders...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883525
    - rid: 9079474705638883526
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: I hate those damn things. Too many eyes, you know?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Y-y-yeah...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Noticing my quivering tone of voice, Ralof looks at me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Talos preserve us, this boy is quaking in his boots!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: As rude as he's being right now, I'm not really in the mood to argue.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Especially not with those eight-legged <i>monsters</i> lurking about.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Sit tight, we'll handle this for you, boy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ralof and the other soldier go charging into battle.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883529
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883530
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Despite having two people personally fighting for me, I in no way felt
      safe.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Grrk... Let's just get moving...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883531
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ralof doesn't acknowledge the pale corpse of his comrade, lying among
      the spiders.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Survivor's guilt is kind of kicking in...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Hold up. There's a bear ahead. See her?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883533
    - rid: 9079474705638883532
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm? Oh, yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: I'd rather not tangle with her right now, let's try to sneak by.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No arguments here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us sneak past the bear.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=futura>Sneak Increased to 10
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883534
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I feel extra sneaky...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah! Fresh air, how I've missed you!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883535
    - rid: 9079474705638883536
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alduin flies overhead, luckily not noticing us.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: There he goes. Looks like he's gone for good this time.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: No way to know if anyone else made it out alive...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: But this place will be swarming with Imperials soon, best to clear out
      of here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: The nearest town is Riverwood, my sister works the lumbermill down there.
      Tell her I sent you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: It'd be best if we split ways, I've got more battles waiting for me that
      I don't think you can handle.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Wow... in the game I think he'd pitch joining the Stormcloaks right about
      now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I've killed three more people today than I have in my whole life! Give
      me some credit!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5c06fc500010bb4992b4b645db3d074, type: 2}
    dialog: Good luck out there, boy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: With that, Ralof heads down the path to Riverwood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474705638883537
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: My stomach growls.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah yes, I <i>have</i> been working up a sweat without having had breakfast.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I take a seat on a nearby rock to rest my feet before starting my journey
      to Riverwood.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Heh, Sayori would probably scold me for skipping breakfast-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: OH GOD THE FESTIVAL-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... wait, why am I in Skyrim, anyway?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The pain I've felt so far has been pretty real, so I don't think I'm
      just dreaming...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I might be dead, but I really doubt I died peacefully in my sleep.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Assuming I didn't get murdered...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hm.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: After a few minutes of resting, I get on my feet and start heading to
      Riverwood.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
  playerChoices:
  - choiceText: 
    resultingSequence: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd30022cf9b9f5f4b9c58c9932d73df9, type: 2}
